(The **Feedback System** is a comprehensive web application designed for educational) Tj
T* (institutions to collect, manage, and analyze student feedback. It facilitates a streamlined) Tj
T* (process for students to provide feedback on their courses and instructors, while offering) Tj
T* (robust reporting tools for Heads of Departments \(HODs\) and Administrators.) Tj
